# NVM aware file system in xv6

A file system implementation for xv6 that is aware of non-volatile memory (NVM) characteristics. It implements wear leveling and block remapping to preserve the endurance of NVM blocks, mitigate the limited write-cycle lifespan typical of NVM devices.

## Documentation
go to `/docs` to see the related documents.

## Testing
```
make qemu
nvm_test
```
